{"authorDailyContributionsMap":{"EthanJoshLeong":[{"date":"2026-09-24T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"a3898c449abe8d41aa633edc071762b607ff6555","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update AboutUs.md","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":4,"deletions":5}}},{"hash":"654cc4f785f8db38e29e07193b05bcd3bc959d5a","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update AboutUs.md","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2}}}]},{"date":"2026-09-27T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"b933c5db22946bd32d4f5947ea9506dc54985aa9","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update GitHub Actions build status badge","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":2,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"6182c3276bc428c32013fb640725c4bc4a600b5a","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update user stories in DG","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":16,"deletions":10}}}]},{"date":"2026-09-29T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"65e0fd266931634d6fdd96aac43da667bed8871f","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update user stories","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":15,"deletions":14}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-08T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"2cbdea6a67bd552e532a234841e928b853d1c87f","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"ViewCommandParser.java Add student detail formatter","messageBody":"The current message utilities do not include a dedicated formatter\nfor a full student profile.\n\nThis makes the view command harder to keep consistent with the rest\nof the user-facing output and leaves detail formatting scattered\nacross the codebase.\n\nThis commit adds a `formatStudentDetails` helper in\n`src/main/java/seedu/address/logic/Messages.java` to centralize\nthe formatting logic.\n\nKeeping the formatting in the shared message utility preserves a\nsingle source of truth and makes the view output easier to read\nand maintain.\n\nThe change is limited to the message formatter and matches the\nexisting shared utility pattern used elsewhere in the app.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":20,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"f66f2f602540cd5ced1f93caaa2fce3f25d172d2","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add student view command","messageBody":"This commit introduces a `view` command that displays the details\nof a student selected from the currently shown list.\n\nThe current app can list students but does not support opening a\nsingle student\u0027s detailed profile, which limits the user flow for\ninspection and review.\n\nThe change adds `ViewCommand` and the supporting command wiring so\nusers can request details by index and receive a formatted\nstudent summary.\n\nThis keeps the feature aligned with the existing command structure\nand makes student detail access consistent with the rest of the\naddress book flow.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":72,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"55a40d5519581f078af34284933215e395d322ec","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Wire in student view command","messageBody":"The command parser currently recognizes the existing list of\nfeatures but does not route the `view` command to its parser.\n\nThis leaves the newly added student detail command unreachable\nthrough the standard CLI entry point.\n\nThis commit adds the `ViewCommand` case in\n`AddressBookParser` so the command is parsed and executed.\n\nKeeping the command registration in the central parser preserves\nthe existing command-dispatch structure and makes the feature\navailable to users.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":2,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"07db889c9b6a173022d4cd37a492d48311e1d89e","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add view command parser","messageBody":"The app currently routes commands through the parser, but it does\nnot yet have a dedicated parser for the new `view` command.\n\nThis commit adds `ViewCommandParser` so a valid student index is\nparsed into a `ViewCommand` and invalid input is reported with the\nstandard invalid-command format message.\n\nThis keeps the feature aligned with the rest of the command\narchitecture and preserves the existing parsing conventions.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":31,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"ea62caed0eac17e3c635fcbd92904cbda9f38b25","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add view command tests","messageBody":"The app now includes a student detail view flow, but the new\ncommand and parser paths are not yet fully exercised by tests.\n\nThis commit adds focused JUnit coverage for the `view` command,\nits parser, and the shared message formatter so the new behavior\nis verified at the command, parser, and output layers.\n\nThe coverage keeps validation aligned with the existing test\nstructure and confirms that valid input succeeds while invalid\ninput produces the expected error handling.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":129,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"65d5417370f292f8018130b8ee7cca5fa3f80d93","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix checkstyle error","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":0,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"1ab2817538e851f1e577f3888f906811c0d1e720","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #97 from zRayhhh/add-student","messageBody":"Add more testing for Studio Group data field","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"zRayhhh":[{"date":"2026-09-24T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"392adc19e1822062d639665cd20e978fa235e965","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #14 from zRayhhh/add-profile-photo","messageBody":"Add Ruihan\u0027s profile photo","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"f263208fd95dc3570ae0878bbf7af700c4a4b65c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update Ruihan\u0027s details in AboutUs page","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":5,"deletions":6}}}]},{"date":"2026-09-28T00:00:0